# A degree-8 polynomial in Horner form: every "*x + c" step is one MAC, so
# --fuse-mac turns this into a chain of 8 accel.mac ops. Used by the benchmark.
#   p(x) = 2x^8 + 3x^7 + 5x^6 + 7x^5 + 11x^4 + 13x^3 + 17x^2 + 19x + 23
def horner8(x) =
  (((((((2*x + 3)*x + 5)*x + 7)*x + 11)*x + 13)*x + 17)*x + 19)*x + 23;
